WEBVTT

00:23.481 --> 00:24.315
Your friend?

00:24.983 --> 00:26.901
Can you explain what
you mentioned earlier?

00:27.402 --> 00:28.361
Well,

00:28.945 --> 00:30.989
there's a kid whose name is Oh Beom-seok.

00:31.072 --> 00:32.824
He goes to Byuksan High School,
over there.

00:32.907 --> 00:33.783
- Oh Beom-seok?
- Yes.

00:34.284 --> 00:36.411
So, earlier, he called me out to a café,

00:36.911 --> 00:39.164
- but he wasn't there by himself.
- Yeong-a.

00:41.416 --> 00:42.459
Are you okay?

00:45.754 --> 00:46.629
Are you alright?

00:46.713 --> 00:48.465
Where'd the other students go?

00:50.800 --> 00:52.135
I was the only one there.

00:54.596 --> 00:55.346
Listen,

00:55.847 --> 00:57.807
it's all right,
okay? You can be honest with us.

00:58.308 --> 00:59.642
You can trust us.

01:02.020 --> 01:03.354
I was there alone.

01:03.938 --> 01:04.981
Stop lying.

01:07.192 --> 01:08.193
Don't tell…

01:09.861 --> 01:11.446
Su-ho about what happened today.

01:12.155 --> 01:12.989
What?

01:16.534 --> 01:17.494
Hey, Yeon Si-eun.

01:21.706 --> 01:22.582
Hey, Si-eun-a!

02:07.877 --> 02:08.753
Beom-seok-a.

02:13.591 --> 02:14.425
Yeah?

02:15.844 --> 02:17.178
It's time to stop.

02:19.597 --> 02:21.224
Stop messing with Su-ho.

03:05.852 --> 03:08.062
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 1

04:03.993 --> 04:08.706
DIVIDING NUMBERS WITH TWO AND THREE DIGITS

04:08.790 --> 04:12.460
Honey, I just asked what you were doing
while he was out getting hurt.

04:12.543 --> 04:13.670
What's wrong with that?

04:14.003 --> 04:15.421
You're not the only busy one.

04:16.005 --> 04:19.759
Do you think I just relax at home,
while you're out training and competing?

04:20.551 --> 04:22.136
You said you wanted to work together.

04:22.637 --> 04:24.597
You said you'd help raise our kid well.

04:24.681 --> 04:26.724
It was your idea to have
a kid in the first place.

04:26.808 --> 04:28.142
I thought it would be easy!

04:30.436 --> 04:33.481
He always gets hurt.
I thought that he would be a normal kid.

04:42.282 --> 04:43.408
Si-Si-Si-eun-a.

04:44.075 --> 04:44.617
Si-eun-a.

04:48.162 --> 04:49.080
Si-eun-a.

04:49.580 --> 04:51.833
Open the door, Si-eun-a. Talk to me.

04:52.458 --> 04:53.376
Si-eun-a,

04:53.626 --> 04:55.044
will you open the door? Hmm?

04:56.754 --> 04:57.672
Si-eun-a.

04:58.256 --> 05:00.675
Open the door,
Si-eun-a. Talk to me, please?

05:02.719 --> 05:03.761
Yeon Si-eun,

05:04.721 --> 05:07.432
Mom and dad weren't fighting,
we were just talking.

05:07.515 --> 05:08.683
Si-eun-a.

05:10.685 --> 05:12.103
Si-eun-a, Yeon Si-eun.

05:12.854 --> 05:13.813
Si-eun-a.

05:16.899 --> 05:17.817
Si-eun-a.

05:27.910 --> 05:29.037
It's all right.

05:29.620 --> 05:30.538
Tell me the truth.

05:32.248 --> 05:34.876
Was it the same jerks who punched
your face last time?

05:36.336 --> 05:37.337
I'm telling the truth.

05:37.837 --> 05:39.422
I fell down the stairs.

05:40.506 --> 05:42.342
I don't believe that's what happened.

05:43.509 --> 05:44.510
Why were you there?

05:46.679 --> 05:47.597
No reason.

05:51.601 --> 05:53.394
I'm going to transfer
you to another school.

05:54.312 --> 05:55.480
That's all there is to it.

05:55.563 --> 05:56.397
I don't want to.

05:57.065 --> 05:57.940
You don't what?

05:59.025 --> 06:00.693
Why are you being like that?

06:01.444 --> 06:03.446
I mean,
it's hard enough raising you by myself.

06:03.529 --> 06:05.114
- Why won't you listen?
- Hey dad,

06:08.993 --> 06:10.578
I've been kinda wondering.

06:12.246 --> 06:15.083
How come you're so interested
in my life all of a sudden?

06:16.667 --> 06:17.502
What?

06:25.593 --> 06:26.511
Nothing.

07:16.769 --> 07:17.603
Yes?

07:19.939 --> 07:21.357
Beom-seok-kun is here at home.

07:21.441 --> 07:22.442
How did it go?

07:22.525 --> 07:24.318
The Seocho Police Station will keep quiet,

07:24.402 --> 07:25.570
and for his school,

07:25.653 --> 07:27.572
I've already spoken to the principal.

07:28.239 --> 07:29.866
The madam went to Jeju Island,

07:29.949 --> 07:31.951
so keep an eye on him
and stay by his side.

07:32.034 --> 07:34.036
Who knows what Beom-seok will do next.

07:37.206 --> 07:40.209
He's being sent abroad.
Find him a school in the Phillipines.

07:40.293 --> 07:41.085
Alright.

07:44.589 --> 07:45.631
How did you know?

07:50.261 --> 07:51.137
Aide Park-nim,

07:51.637 --> 07:53.431
told me that I would find you in there.

07:54.891 --> 07:56.184
About yesterday.

08:00.396 --> 08:01.814
I got a call from the police.

08:03.149 --> 08:04.108
Yeon Si-eun.

08:05.193 --> 08:06.861
He wanted to let this incident go.

08:07.361 --> 08:08.946
He said that he was your friend.

08:13.618 --> 08:15.912
What's important is what they demanded.

08:16.579 --> 08:17.497
In this revolt…

08:18.873 --> 08:19.874
Someone wake him up.

08:21.542 --> 08:22.960
- Everyone, stay awake.
- Hey, Su-ho.

08:23.461 --> 08:24.670
Ahn Su-ho.

08:25.546 --> 08:26.839
Where did we leave off?

08:29.258 --> 08:30.593
Why is no one answering me?

08:32.595 --> 08:34.055
The class president should know.

08:35.056 --> 08:36.807
The Japan-Korea Treaty
of eighteen seventy-six.

08:36.891 --> 08:38.267
Alright then, in that case,

08:40.478 --> 08:42.438
turn to page one-o-nine.

08:42.522 --> 08:44.982
Let's learn about the Donghak Uprising.

08:46.526 --> 08:48.152
Shall we begin?

08:48.236 --> 08:51.364
To understand the Donghak Uprising,
first we have to learn about

08:51.447 --> 08:52.156
the peasant forces…

08:57.036 --> 08:58.162
AHN SU-HO

09:05.044 --> 09:08.798
SOMETHING CAME UP AT HOME
SO I CAN'T COME TO SCHOOL FOR A WHILE

09:13.052 --> 09:14.428
Where were you last night?

09:14.512 --> 09:16.764
Huh? You ignored all my calls.

09:17.390 --> 09:18.224
What?

09:21.978 --> 09:25.231
Are you messing with me for my birthday
still? Is that what's goin' on?

09:25.314 --> 09:26.148
Huh?

09:27.400 --> 09:28.442
That's enough.

09:28.526 --> 09:29.610
It's not funny.

09:31.737 --> 09:32.989
I'm not doing that.

09:33.906 --> 09:34.907
Sorry about yesterday.

10:11.152 --> 10:12.612
- Whoa!
- What the hell.

10:13.654 --> 10:14.655
Let's go for a smoke.

10:14.739 --> 10:15.823
Damn it.

10:21.704 --> 10:22.538
Shit.

10:28.919 --> 10:30.546
Why's Oh Beom-seok absent?

10:32.798 --> 10:33.716
No idea.

10:34.634 --> 10:35.926
Haven't you called him?

10:36.677 --> 10:38.054
You guys are pretty tight.

10:38.888 --> 10:40.097
His phone's turned off.

10:40.181 --> 10:41.098
You know what's up?

10:41.641 --> 10:43.601
Tell him he owes me for the damages.

10:44.185 --> 10:44.935
Yeah, I know.

10:49.231 --> 10:49.899
What?

10:51.817 --> 10:52.610
What damages?

10:57.823 --> 10:59.492
It cost eight hundred thousand won.

11:01.410 --> 11:02.953
If you don't pay me back, I'll kill ya.

11:03.037 --> 11:03.871
'Kay?

11:06.666 --> 11:07.583
Answer me.

11:09.126 --> 11:09.960
Okay.

11:14.423 --> 11:15.675
JEONG-CHAN

11:22.932 --> 11:25.101
- Your call cannot be completed as dialed.
- God damnit, pick up

11:25.184 --> 11:26.060
your phone, Beom-seok.

11:26.143 --> 11:27.687
Please leave a message after the tone.

11:27.770 --> 11:29.563
Ahn Su-ho needs to be taught a lesson.

11:30.147 --> 11:32.191
Hey, but why isn't Yeon Si-eun at school?

11:32.817 --> 11:34.068
Did he actually die?

11:34.902 --> 11:36.821
- Yeong-bin was way over the line.
- Hey,

11:37.446 --> 11:38.698
what's with all the bullshit.

11:39.198 --> 11:42.368
We'd all be attending his funeral
if he was dead, dude.

11:43.411 --> 11:44.412
Damn it.

11:46.330 --> 11:47.206
Aw man.

12:09.854 --> 12:10.813
Wait, please, wait.

12:12.648 --> 12:14.024
Oh Beom-seok called you,

12:14.525 --> 12:15.818
but you wouldn't pick up,

12:15.901 --> 12:17.027
so he brought that girl over

12:17.528 --> 12:18.988
to make you come meet us.

12:19.864 --> 12:20.698
What?

12:21.198 --> 12:21.949
You know,

12:22.450 --> 12:24.535
that girl, who lives with you. But

12:25.995 --> 12:28.122
we expected you instead, not Yeon Si-eun.

12:37.882 --> 12:39.467
- And?
- A-A-And

12:39.550 --> 12:41.635
Yeong-bin has this friend,
who was paid by Oh Beom-seok

12:41.719 --> 12:42.720
to beat you up.

12:45.347 --> 12:47.767
Oh Beom-seok did everything.
None of this was us.

13:08.537 --> 13:09.455
What's going on?

13:11.999 --> 13:13.375
Where's Si-eun hospitalized?

13:21.675 --> 13:22.760
He went home today.

13:25.971 --> 13:27.348
I'm sorry. It's all 'cause of me.

13:34.063 --> 13:34.897
Hey!

13:43.197 --> 13:45.658
Si-eun told me I had to keep
it a secret from you.

13:48.118 --> 13:49.119
Stay out of trouble.

14:07.346 --> 14:08.055
Who is it?

14:10.599 --> 14:11.517
Delivery.

14:16.063 --> 14:16.647
Hey,

14:17.147 --> 14:18.148
what's up?

14:18.858 --> 14:19.942
What do you mean, what's up?

14:20.442 --> 14:21.694
I'm thirsty.

14:21.777 --> 14:22.778
Give me water.

14:40.629 --> 14:41.505
You doin' alright?

14:44.800 --> 14:45.384
Sure,

14:45.885 --> 14:46.844
yeah.

14:47.344 --> 14:48.137
Why're you here?

14:48.637 --> 14:51.181
I was just in the neighborhood.

15:05.946 --> 15:06.739
Are you okay?

15:11.076 --> 15:11.911
Why?

15:19.543 --> 15:20.544
Tomorrow's finals.

15:20.628 --> 15:21.670
Coming to school?

15:25.090 --> 15:25.925
Yeah.

15:26.884 --> 15:27.801
I gotta study.

15:29.136 --> 15:29.845
Okay,

15:30.429 --> 15:31.221
good.

15:32.056 --> 15:32.932
See you in class.

16:37.705 --> 16:38.664
Is he in his room?

16:38.747 --> 16:39.665
Yes, sir.

16:42.251 --> 16:43.836
You crazy little bastard!

16:44.628 --> 16:46.505
You're nothing but fucking vermin.

16:47.548 --> 16:48.257
I-

16:48.757 --> 16:51.135
told you not to do anything
that shits on my name.

16:51.802 --> 16:53.887
You didn't listen. Huh?

16:53.971 --> 16:55.222
You little shit!

16:55.305 --> 16:57.141
What's your goddamn problem?!

16:57.224 --> 17:01.228
I told you to do what I say,
barely breathe, and live a quiet life.

17:01.729 --> 17:03.564
You're so pathetic, that was too hard?

17:03.647 --> 17:04.440
Is that too hard?

17:04.940 --> 17:06.025
You shit, answer me.

17:06.525 --> 17:07.985
Fucking loser!

17:08.068 --> 17:10.404
You're such a fucking little bitch!

17:11.238 --> 17:13.657
Wooo! This fucking little bastard.

17:14.575 --> 17:15.284
You.

17:16.493 --> 17:18.454
Once you go study abroad,

17:19.121 --> 17:21.040
you're free to do whatever
the hell you want.

17:21.123 --> 17:22.916
Die from drugs, I don't give a shit.

17:24.293 --> 17:26.670
Just never tell anyone
that you are my son.

17:27.296 --> 17:28.589
Understand?!

17:29.548 --> 17:30.382
Hey!

17:31.425 --> 17:32.676
Keep an eye on this punk.

17:39.892 --> 17:41.560
I never asked to be your son.

18:02.247 --> 18:03.040
Beom-seok-kun.

18:03.749 --> 18:05.375
Fuck off, damn it.

18:06.335 --> 18:07.503
Hands off-

18:07.586 --> 18:08.545
don't follow me.

18:16.303 --> 18:18.388
- Where are you headed?
- Just drive, please.

18:41.578 --> 18:47.668
MISSED CALL: SU-HO, JEONG-CHAN
YEONG-BIN, TAE-HUN

18:48.627 --> 18:50.003
SU-HO
IMAGE

18:52.005 --> 18:54.716
ANSWER THE PHONE,
OR I WILL KILL YOUR FRIENDS

19:01.598 --> 19:02.432
Agh.

19:02.933 --> 19:04.059
Hey, wait.

19:04.643 --> 19:05.227
Agh.

19:05.727 --> 19:06.520
So you better…

19:08.147 --> 19:09.314
get Oh Beom-seok.

19:11.275 --> 19:13.235
I can't, I have no idea where he went.

19:13.318 --> 19:15.154
He's not answering any of my calls.

19:21.326 --> 19:23.620
- Ah, shit.
- Punishment's the same then.

19:39.720 --> 19:40.846
BEOM-SEOK

19:48.645 --> 19:49.605
Where you at?

19:56.612 --> 19:58.197
Where are you, bitch-ass?

20:00.949 --> 20:01.783
Why?

20:03.327 --> 20:04.161
Oh Beom-seok.

20:06.246 --> 20:07.414
You better stop hiding.

20:24.473 --> 20:25.557
Agh, shit man.

20:36.318 --> 20:37.819
OH BEOM-SEOK

20:45.786 --> 20:46.620
Hey, what's up?

20:51.959 --> 20:53.210
Ahn Su-ho's game on.

20:55.170 --> 20:56.088
I'll pay.

21:26.368 --> 21:27.202
Hello?

21:28.412 --> 21:29.246
Hey.

21:30.831 --> 21:32.582
Have you been in touch with Su-ho?

21:35.002 --> 21:35.669
Yeah,

21:36.169 --> 21:37.587
he stopped by earlier today.

21:39.381 --> 21:41.508
Su-ho found out about that fight.

21:42.592 --> 21:43.385
What?

21:44.970 --> 21:47.556
He's not at work,
and he's not picking up his phone.

21:50.225 --> 21:51.768
Did he say anything to you?

21:56.523 --> 21:57.441
Do you think

21:58.817 --> 22:00.485
he went looking for Oh Beom-seok?

22:02.863 --> 22:03.989
I'll try to call him.

22:26.470 --> 22:27.512
You filming a movie?

22:29.973 --> 22:31.266
What the hell is this?

22:32.017 --> 22:33.060
Seriously.

22:36.396 --> 22:37.439
Where's Oh Beom-seok?

23:24.986 --> 23:25.862
It's been a while.

23:31.993 --> 23:33.703
I'm the one that you're mad at.

23:34.746 --> 23:36.706
Why're you messing with the others?

23:38.375 --> 23:39.793
What did they do wrong?

23:48.009 --> 23:49.136
I'm sorry

23:54.641 --> 23:56.059
for hurting your feelings.

24:02.649 --> 24:03.984
I apologized to you.

24:06.820 --> 24:08.864
Your turn to apologize
to Si-eun and Yeong-i.

24:12.409 --> 24:13.326
No thanks.

24:15.328 --> 24:16.997
I have nothing to apologize for.

24:19.916 --> 24:21.001
Please just do it.

24:26.339 --> 24:27.591
I said no.

24:33.680 --> 24:34.806
Then, you'll get beaten

24:36.516 --> 24:37.767
'til you come to your senses.

24:44.816 --> 24:45.734
Hey, Ahn Su-ho.

24:49.654 --> 24:50.489
Ah.

24:53.575 --> 24:54.701
Climb in.

24:56.703 --> 24:58.663
Are you seriously paying
this asshole money

25:00.081 --> 25:01.249
just to beat me up?

25:06.046 --> 25:07.964
You're really pathetic, you know that?

25:14.971 --> 25:15.847
Gimme a sec.

25:15.931 --> 25:16.806
I need to warm up.

25:18.016 --> 25:18.683
Shit.

25:19.809 --> 25:20.727
Oh, shit!

25:24.231 --> 25:25.065
Hey!

25:39.329 --> 25:40.956
I guess you're still working out.

25:41.665 --> 25:43.291
Some people might think
you're still an athlete.

25:43.375 --> 25:45.460
Do you not remember me kicking your ass?

25:48.255 --> 25:49.130
Get in.

26:06.773 --> 26:07.315
Well,

26:07.816 --> 26:09.401
the moment is finally here, my hyung-nims.

26:09.484 --> 26:11.528
I told you I lost badly to this guy

26:12.028 --> 26:13.613
back in middle school, right?

26:14.072 --> 26:16.241
This fight,
is going to be my revenge match.

26:17.075 --> 26:17.951
Salute.

26:19.035 --> 26:19.911
They're starting.

26:19.995 --> 26:21.246
I bet he can friggin' fight.

26:21.329 --> 26:23.582
For sure, whatever. Let's go.

26:23.665 --> 26:24.708
Let's make the video fun,

26:25.208 --> 26:26.042
yeah?

26:26.751 --> 26:27.586
Please, Woo-yeong.

26:27.669 --> 26:30.505
- You have to win. You're our only hope.
- Talkin' shit?

26:33.842 --> 26:35.510
- Ooh-ooh-ooh.
- What was that?

26:41.516 --> 26:42.809
Ooh-ooh-ooh.

26:43.602 --> 26:45.478
Fuck man, that was so close.

26:47.731 --> 26:48.607
- Yeah, yeah!
- Get him!

26:49.107 --> 26:49.983
Woo!

26:50.066 --> 26:51.443
Your left leg's fucked up? Huh?

26:51.526 --> 26:53.528
- Dude.
- And what are you gonna do about it?

26:59.951 --> 27:00.910
- Woah, woah.
- Woah, woah!

27:01.036 --> 27:02.245
Woah, woah, woah.

27:02.329 --> 27:03.204
Behind you!

27:03.288 --> 27:04.497
Get up, Woo-yeong!

27:05.915 --> 27:06.791
Damn it.

27:06.875 --> 27:08.877
- Get up, get up!
- Come on!

27:09.377 --> 27:10.670
You got this!

27:12.714 --> 27:15.133
- Woo-yeong. Hit him, Woo-yeong!
- Woo-yeong!

27:15.216 --> 27:16.092
- Get your revenge!
- Kick his ass!

27:16.176 --> 27:18.053
His leg. Yes! Get it.

27:18.219 --> 27:20.055
- Okay!
- Great job, Woo-yeong!

27:21.222 --> 27:23.433
Go get him Woo-yeong! Do it.

27:23.516 --> 27:25.477
Show your power. Aw, shit.

27:25.560 --> 27:26.895
Oh, fuck.

27:27.812 --> 27:29.856
- You got lucky.
- Fuck you, asshole.

27:35.236 --> 27:37.197
Kill him. Kill that fucking bastard.

27:42.494 --> 27:43.453
That's not good.

27:50.752 --> 27:52.253
- What the fuck, dude.
- Hey!

27:52.337 --> 27:53.463
Eat shit!

28:08.937 --> 28:09.896
He's so fucked.

28:11.022 --> 28:12.982
- Oh, look at that asshole.
- Yeah, dude.

28:13.566 --> 28:14.359
Fuck, man.

28:15.193 --> 28:15.819
Okay.

28:16.403 --> 28:19.114
- Man, that was a fucking fight.
- They're fucking crazy.

28:30.709 --> 28:31.543
Hey.

28:33.294 --> 28:34.879
Who's the pathetic one now, shithead.

28:34.963 --> 28:35.797
Huh?

28:39.592 --> 28:40.427
Huh?

28:41.553 --> 28:43.054
Tell me what to do now, man.

28:47.892 --> 28:49.519
Who the fuck do you think you are

28:50.103 --> 28:51.938
you're always looking down on me like

28:52.772 --> 28:54.149
like I'm a piece of shit.

28:55.900 --> 28:56.735
Hey,

28:59.571 --> 29:01.322
Will you please just wake up?

29:06.828 --> 29:09.122
And stop blaming other people,
Beom-seok-a.

29:12.584 --> 29:13.418
Hey.

29:14.461 --> 29:17.338
Stop saying my fucking name,
you cocky shit.

29:19.758 --> 29:20.341
Bitch.

29:20.842 --> 29:21.676
You son of a bitch.

29:23.094 --> 29:24.012
Damn it.

29:24.095 --> 29:25.597
Hey, fuck this. Let's jump in.

29:28.892 --> 29:30.226
- Son of a bitch.
- Bastard.

29:30.310 --> 29:30.769
Cocky shit.

29:31.269 --> 29:32.312
- You fucking asshole.
- Asshole.

29:32.395 --> 29:35.315
You're pathetic. Son of a bitch.

29:35.398 --> 29:37.901
Stupid shithead. Fuck you.

29:38.693 --> 29:40.236
- That's how you do it.
- Fucking dick.

29:40.320 --> 29:40.987
Ugh, you fuck.

29:41.488 --> 29:42.489
- Shithead!
- Don't tell me what to do.

29:42.572 --> 29:43.740
You fucking little bitch!

29:43.823 --> 29:45.533
- You fucking asshole!
- Eat it, you stupid fuck!!

29:45.617 --> 29:46.743
You son of a bitch.

